ce.dht` function of that name, `retry` and `cancel`,\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:104:   `module-status`, answered by the `yin.vm.linker.dht` function of that\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:105:   name (yin.vm.linker.dht.md 10).\"\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:106:  {'load-index ::dht-load-index\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:107:   'load-status ::dht-load-status\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:108:   'q ::dht-q\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:109:   'retry ::dht-retry\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:110:   'cancel ::dht-cancel\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:111:   'load-module ::dht-load-module\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:112:   'module-status ::dht-module-status})\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:118:   (yin.vm.linker.dht.md 10), over the shell's own DHT node.\"\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:124:   `publish`, answered by `yin.vm.linker.dht/publish-name!`, and `names`,\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:125:   answered by `yin.vm.linker.dht/names`.\"\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:132:   the moved names (yin.vm.linker.dht.head.md 5.6, 5.7), each one call\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:133:   into `yin.vm.linker.head`.\"\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:139:   `heads`, answered by `yin.vm.linker.head/heads` of the shell's\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:140:   follower, and `moved`, by `yin.vm.linker.head/moved`.\"\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:177:(defn- dht-export\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:178:  \"A `dao.space.dht` export: a data constructor whose effect parks the\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:179:   caller on the call pair under the operation `dht-ops` names.\"\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:182:    (module/make-effect ::call {:op (get dht-ops sym), :args (vec args)})))\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:185:(def ^:private dht-arities\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:190:(defn activate-dht\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:191:  \"`registry` with the `dao.space.dht` host module installed.\"\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:194:    registry dht-module-name\nsrc/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc:195:    (i