{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"The existing `dao.jing` API provides verified content storage, but no publication or recovery-install operation. I’ll distinguish the current signatures from the new request/result seam the refactor needs, keeping HEAD persistence and network publication in composition. The acceptance gates will also cover `src/cljc/yin/repl.cljc`, which sits outside the requested directory glob."}}
